# ⚠️  Claude Code does NOT read this file. It has no effect.
#     Real protection lives in .claude/settings.json → permissions.deny
#     (and sandbox.filesystem.denyRead for shell commands).
#     Kept only as human-readable documentation of what is off-limits.
#     Keep this list in sync with settings.json.
.env
.env.*
secrets/
credentials/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.tfstate
*.tfvars
